   "version": "2.1.0",
   "description": "<p><strong>For SPT 3.10.X Only</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Time data is now stored in the new server mod backend</li>\n<li>Raids that last 5 minutes or less won’t experience a time jump, instead they will only advance by the amount of time spent in the raid * the cycle rate. Idea here is to make super short raids still feel short.</li>\n<li>Fika compatibility improved</li>\n<li>Full patch notes here: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Jehree/SPT-ImmersiveDaylightCycle/releases/tag/v2.1.0\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/Jehree/SPT-ImmersiveDaylightCycle/releases/tag/v2.1.0</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/1462/immersive-daylight-cycle/2.1.0",
